  "title": "Soft and Chewy Pumpkin Cookies",
  "description": "This soft and chewy pumpkin cookies made with butter, oats, brown and white sugar, raisins, and pumpkin purée, make the perfect fall treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Ruth"
  ],
